# ez's proofs: each file under proofs/ fills the laws of the file of the
# same name under laws/. Lemmas several proofs share are in proofs/lemmas/,
# and src/check/eq.bend and src/check/str.bend state Base facts Base does not
# and prove them in place. The gate: `bend PROOF.bend` prints exactly
# `ALL PROOFS CHECK` as its first line.
